h3 2.7.3 Restricting to the same agent cluster
text Some objects, such as  objects, are restricted to the same : they can only be deserialized or received in the agent cluster they were serialized or transferred from. Such objects also cannot be serialized for storage. For example, when  is used to send one to a cross-site , a shared worker, or a service worker, a  event is fired instead of a  event.
